{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本要點依本府執行違章建築取締辦法第六條暨建築法第九十六條之一第一\n項規定訂定之。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL034336/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"369db3b7bc62ee6493140402e08539318ab699bb17deb4877f5cc28d4665b1fc","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"執行範圍：依本府執行違章建築取締辦法第三條規定之執行順序，依限處\n理，由本府訂定每月應拆除之件數基準，列管追蹤處理。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL034336/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"ae51b2a5ea1395c0709e7e53f945df18a199396eb4f34d33852c785b2e83f956","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"執行方式:\n (一) 八十六年十二月三十一日以前之違章建築，由本府每年編列預算，\n      逐年進行拆除。\n (二) 八十七年一月一日以後之新違章建築，應依違章建築處理辦法規定\n      即報即拆，拆除費用，依本要點第四條規定之標準計算，由義務人\n      負擔。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL034336/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"37b806443f6a6ae8df9b1264c102151c21ec0ba20e22109327a82bcb688fed0b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"拆除費用，依附表規定按違章建築構造類別及拆除面積計算之。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL034336/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"91f87e8735b4e3b10a99ac5effed38789e04c96f0c2878503ad7f2e51164db48","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"本要點公佈後，本府應定期召開全縣各鄉鎮市公所違建取締承辦人協調作\n業會報，提出成果報告並作檢討。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL034336/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"132a7a8d2788b65dfd1e76229f72129f3f04147594046e7e99777e02daa8a667","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"違建拆除結案後，由本府列冊交由各鄉鎮市公所按月呈報追蹤績效，本府\n得隨時抽查。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL034336/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"f45e05fee4aeee4a6c2e64d850e56d798a10b9f202ad6a9d8c5198595cf6ceca","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"有關違建督導考核及獎懲要點由本府另訂之。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL034336/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"ece4537e54b385637fcc8ef255e4e47601fb1c843f3d6e66756ca7d3b594c19c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"要點奉縣長核定後公行，修正時亦同。","id":"宜蘭縣-FL034336/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"30729ae3522062cc69d5b0a19b8b0fb5f865e84e9ac361150c3b0501eca23c13","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[{"title":"附件.DOC","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=544&id=FL034336&type=LAW"}],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"宜蘭縣-FL034336","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"宜蘭縣政府取締違章建築執行要點","region":"宜蘭縣","source":"宜蘭縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://glrslaw.e-land.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=FL034336","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:34:39+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"9c324b967422914999ac738ae460c8d5f9f45433df79763d7c3dd1447a7f4938","sourceRecordId":"宜蘭縣-FL034336","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}